{
  "doc": "tools/check_data_family.py 的文件清单（lane seq4；lane seq6 起 scenes 那条的 kinds / shapes 也是 verify_story_data 的形状表——单一来源，改这里两道门禁同时认）。同族 = scenes.json 那一族：主表是带唯一字符串 id 的条目表（F1），条目里有字段指向同表的 id、成一张图（F2），游戏运行时读它（F3，scripts/ 或 scenes/ 里写了文件名），且图有入口，「从入口走不到 = 孤儿」有定义（F4，人判，写在 roots 里）。F1–F3 由脚本自动普查：data/ 下满足 F1–F3 的文件必须登在 families（同族，跑四项结构检查）或 not_family（写明 F4 为何不成立）之一，漏登即红。新增同族文件怎么接入：见 check_data_family.py 文档串「接入」一段。",
  "families": [
    {
      "file": "data/scenes.json",
      "table": "scenes",
      "id": "id",
      "top": {
        "start_scene": "str",
        "scenes": "list"
      },
      "kinds": [
        {
          "name": "deprecated",
          "when": {
            "field": "deprecated",
            "eq": true
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>",
            "deprecated": "bool",
            "objective?": "str"
          },
          "orphan_ok": "显式标了 deprecated: true 的留档幕，本就不进主线"
        },
        {
          "name": "title",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "title"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "cg": "str",
            "cg_title": "str",
            "cg_sub": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "port",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "port"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "facilities": "list<@facility>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "investigation",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "investigation"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "investigations": "list<@investigation>",
            "choices": "list<@choice>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "result",
          "when": {
            "has": "result"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "result": "str|list<str>",
            "options?": "list<@option>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "story",
          "when": {},
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>",
            "cg?": "str",
            "objective?": "str",
            "speaker?": "str",
            "require_any?": "list<str>",
            "require_chapter?": "int",
            "require_flag?": "str",
            "hide_if_flag?": "str"
          }
        }
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "choice": {
          "label": "str",
          "next": "str",
          "effects?": "dict",
          "require_chapter?": "int",
          "require_any?": "list<str>",
          "require_flag?": "str",
          "hide_if_flag?": "str"
        },
        "investigation": {
          "id": "str",
          "label": "str",
          "text": "str",
          "effects": "dict",
          "next": "str"
        },
        "facility": {
          "id": "str",
          "title": "str",
          "subtitle": "str",
          "body": "str"
        },
        "option": {
          "label": "str"
        }
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "choices[].next",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            },
            {
              "file": "data/ports.json",
              "path": "ports[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "Main.load_scene 先查 scenes.json、再查 ports.json（通用港口页）"
        },
        {
          "path": "investigations[].next",
          "edge": true,
          "allow_empty": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "Main._on_investigate_pressed：next 空串 = 留在本页、按钮置灰"
        },
        {
          "path": "investigations[].id",
          "edge": false,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "调查项 id → 同名详情场（带 result 的幕）须存在；Main._on_investigate_pressed 只读 text / effects / next，不按 id 跳，所以不成边（与 lane seq3 口径同）"
        },
        {
          "path": "location",
          "edge": false,
          "to": [
            {
              "file": "data/ports.json",
              "path": "ports[].id"
            },
            {
              "py_const": "tools/verify_story_data.py",
              "name": "SCENE_LOCATION_EXTRA"
            }
          ],
          "why": "幕的所在地 = 港 id（或 sea）。普查里 29/67 个值恰是本表 id，是因为 type=port 港页的 id 就是港 id——同名，不是跳转，不成边（lane seq6：部分命中的自引用也须登记）"
        },
        {
          "path": "facilities[].id",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            },
            {
              "gd_const": "scripts/Main.gd",
              "name": "REMAPPED_FACILITIES"
            }
          ],
          "why": "港卡设施门 id 须是 Main.REMAPPED_FACILITIES 之一；只有 PROLOGUE_ONLY_FACILITIES 里的港卡直进同名 scenes.json 幕（成边），其余被改写成 {港}_{后缀} 动态页、进不到 scenes.json（与 lane seq3 口径同）",
          "edge_if": {
            "gd_const": "scripts/Main.gd",
            "name": "PROLOGUE_ONLY_FACILITIES"
          }
        }
      ],
      "not_edges": [],
      "roots": [
        {
          "path": "start_scene",
          "must": true,
          "why": "开局幕"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/ports.json",
          "path": "ports[].id",
          "why": "海图抵港 load_scene(港 id)，同名 type=port 幕由此进"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/chapters.json",
          "path": "chapters[].advance_scene",
          "why": "升章过场后进的幕"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/chapters.json",
          "path": "chapters[].endings[].scene",
          "why": "第四章结局幕"
        },
        {
          "gd_calls": "load_scene",
          "why": "scripts/ 里 load_scene(\"字面量\") 直跳"
        }
      ],
      "known_orphans": [
        {
          "from": {
            "py_const": "tools/verify_story_data.py",
            "name": "SCENE_ARCHIVE"
          },
          "why": "基线与 lane seq3 的 scenes.json 结构门禁共用一份：verify_story_data.SCENE_ARCHIVE（39 个：序章旧链 4、city_tavern / city_shipyard 两个港卡被 REMAPPED 改写进不到的调查页、result 形详情场 33），只减不增由那边的 SCENE_ARCHIVE_MAX 管；这里另判名单里的已可达 / 已删 / 已 deprecated"
        }
      ],
      "shapes_doc": "lane seq6：本条 kinds / shapes 是 scenes.json 形状的唯一一份。verify_story_data（必跑）不再自带 SCENE_SHAPES / SCENE_SUB_SHAPES / SCENE_FIELD_TYPES，由这里按字段名推出（`名?` = 可选；list<@形> 的字段 = 列表子形；同名字段在各形里类型须一致）；加字段 / 加形改这里一处，两道门禁同时认"
    },
    {
      "file": "data/ports.json",
      "table": "ports",
      "id": "id",
      "top": {
        "meta": "dict",
        "ports": "list"
      },
      "kinds": [
        {
          "name": "port",
          "when": {},
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "name": "str",
            "region": "str",
            "status": "str",
            "lat": "num",
            "lon": "num",
            "chart": "dict",
            "depth": "int",
            "unlock": "str",
            "tags": "list<str>",
            "connections": "list<str>",
            "market": "dict",
            "war?": "dict",
            "war_notice?": "dict"
          }
        }
      ],
      "shapes": {},
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "connections[]",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "熟路连线；Voyage.is_known_route 按无向认，不相连只能走生路"
        },
        {
          "path": "market{}",
          "to": [
            {
              "file": "data/goods.json",
              "path": "goods[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "牙行货表的键是货物 id"
        }
      ],
      "undirected": true,
      "not_edges": [],
      "roots": [
        {
          "gd_regex": "scripts/GameState.gd",
          "pattern": "^var last_port: String = \"([a-z_]+)\"",
          "must": true,
          "why": "GameState.last_port 缺省值 = 开局港"
        }
      ],
      "known_orphans": [],
      "one_way_ok": {
        "pairs": [],
        "why": "lane seq6 判留、lane w20-b4 补齐：运行时只有 Voyage.is_known_route（两头都查）与 MapView._draw_lanes（按无序对去重）读 connections，都按无向认，玩家看到的熟路不受影响；seq6 实测把当时 3 对（guangzhou→quanzhou / guangzhou→zhangzhou / kagoshima→ryukyu）的对侧补齐后 simulate_run / simulate_endgame / verify_economy 输出逐字节不变，w20-b4 按此把 quanzhou / zhangzhou / ryukyu 三港补回对侧连线、基线清空（全图双向）。新添单向登记即红（补对侧，或登进基线写原因）；基线若有登记、某对补齐了 / 连线删了也红（从这里删掉，只减不增）"
      }
    },
    {
      "file": "data/port_beats.json",
      "table": "beats",
      "id": "entry",
      "top": {
        "beats": "list"
      },
      "kinds": [
        {
          "name": "beat",
          "when": {},
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "entry": "str",
            "port": "str",
            "order": "int",
            "requires": "dict",
            "stop_before": "list<str>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "shapes": {},
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "port",
          "to": [
            {
              "file": "data/ports.json",
              "path": "ports[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "这一拍所在的港（港页 id）。普查里 2/9 个值恰是本表 entry，是因为拍 id 与港同字（ryukyu / hakata 两港的开场拍）——同字，不是本表回指"
        },
        {
          "path": "entry",
          "to": [
            {
              "file": "data/scenes.json",
              "path": "scenes[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "这一拍要演的那一幕。普查里 1/9 个值恰是本表 entry（「回到泉州」针的 entry 名与针同名）——同字，不是本表回指"
        },
        {
          "path": "stop_before[]",
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "他的下一拍（本表 entry），节拍沿它推进；成边在 requires.seen 那一路——剧情依存谁是入口、谁是下一针，靠 stop_before 记名"
        },
        {
          "path": "requires.seen[]",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "条件「照上一拍的戏点出过这一幕」= 链上前一拍 → 这一拍的边（要求里点着的全是本表 entry）"
        },
        {
          "path": "requires.visited[]",
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            },
            {
              "file": "data/ports.json",
              "path": "ports[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "条件「到过这港」：落在本表 entry（流求的开场针 ryukyu_bay——节拍里的「到过流求」 = 玩过那幕）与港页 id 的并集；回本表 = 边"
        }
      ],
      "not_edges": [
        {
          "path": "id",
          "why": "拍的记名（P7 留档沿用），节拍图按 entry 走、不按 id；它在本表的是主键、不是回指（普查 1/9 个值恰是本表 entry：「回到泉州」针 id 与 return_quanzhou 针的 entry 同字）"
        }
      ],
      "roots": [
        {
          "gd_const": "scripts/core/PortBeats.gd",
          "name": "START_ENTRIES",
          "must": true,
          "why": "节拍链的入口：各港 requires 全空针的头一回抵达入口 + 序章已演的 start。链上第一针总是从它起（开局港泉州由 quanzhou_monk 进链）"
        }
      ],
      "known_orphans": [
        {
          "ids": [
            "monk",
            "merchant",
            "dock",
            "prepare"
          ],
          "why": "泉州链 monk→prepare 四针：链路本身靠「照上一拍的戏点出那一幕」走（requires 只指回流求北缘那幕，泉州链的四幕在序章沿途已演过——start 选完三项同指 monk，monk/merchant/dock/prepare 的选择各自链指下一幕=节拍网内自环），账上按 entry 排、入口只锚序章已演的 start 与开局港 / 流求 / 博多三针；运行时按 GameState.beats_seen 记名接演，本组四针在序章沿途的账已在 start 那一钩一起演过，登记为网外针（基线只减不增）"
        },
        {
          "ids": [
            "hakata_ledger",
            "return_quanzhou"
          ],
          "why": "跨港收线两针：hakata_ledger 的条件是 cargo_hakata 旗（博多唐房寄货）、return_quanzhou 的条件是「玩过流求北缘那幕」——它们的入口不是节拍网内的针，是玩家跑商跑到这步的旗 / 演出账；网内从入口（序章 start 与各港开场针）走不到，运行时按条件路由接演"
        },
        {
          "ids": [
            "chapter2_letter"
          ],
          "why": "章二信条的占位针：条件「章二已开」（chapter_at_least），它的入口不在节拍网内、由运行时按章序路由接演；网内无入边"
        },
        {
          "ids": [
            "start"
          ],
          "why": "序章沿途已演的戏（DEFAULT_SEED 记账，不靠入口走得到：跟入口针不同港，序章 start 在 xinghua、入口针 quanzhou_monk / ryukyu_bay 各有自己的港链）——接回运行时后 seed 即记名，登记网外针（基线只减不增）"
        }
      ],
      "f2_min_refs": 2,
      "mutant_skip": [
        "del_req",
        "del_edge",
        "type",
        "dangle",
        "typo",
        "orphan",
        "selfref",
        "known"
      ],
      "mutant_skip_why": "按 entry 记演出账：可达的阵只有 start 与 ryukyu_bay 两针、都不带 requires.seen 回指（成边路靠 requires.seen 指回本表），「兜底形 + 入口可达 + 边字段非空」那一形在本表不存在——七格通用格的形状都挑不到锚 = 登记跳过；演出账的本体校验由 tools/godot_story_check.gd 的节拍断言守（条件 / 拍序 / 开关）"
    }
  ],
  "not_family": [
    {
      "file": "data/characters.json",
      "why": "F1–F3 成立（relations[].id / sources.npc_id / sources.crew_id 指回同表），F4 不成立：relations 是人物志的注记边、不是跳转，图没有入口；实测 25 人无入边属正常（只在别人传里出现的史实人物），孤儿判据无定义。字段 / 文案层另由 verify_story_data（CHAR_STRUCT 等）守"
    }
  ],
  "mutant_register_order": [
    "data/scenes.json"
  ]
}
